// auc-data-v1 — группа «Дом и правила»: все поля её таблиц; таблицы других групп, на которые они ссылаются, — серой рамкой.
// Сгенерировано из описания схемы; руками не править. Картинка (SVG): tools/schema-svg.sh auc.
digraph schema {
  graph [rankdir=LR, fontname="DejaVu Sans", fontsize=13, nodesep=0.35, ranksep=0.9, pad=0.3, splines=true, newrank=true];
  node [shape=plain, fontname="DejaVu Sans", fontsize=11];
  edge [dir=both, arrowtail=none, arrowhead=crow, arrowsize=0.9, color="#333333"];
  subgraph "cluster_house" {
    label=<<B>Дом и правила</B>>;
    style="rounded,filled"; fillcolor="#ececec"; color="#bbbbbb"; margin=14;
    "departments" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>departments</B><BR/>Отделы</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="code"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>code</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_en"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_en</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="sort_order"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>sort_order</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "categories" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>categories</B><BR/>Категории</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="department_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>department_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="parent_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>parent_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="level"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>level</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="code"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>code</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_en"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_en</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "cities" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>cities</B><BR/>Города</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_en"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_en</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="region_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>region_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="federal_district"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>federal_district</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="lat"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>lat</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="lon"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>lon</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="timezone"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>timezone</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="population"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>population</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "offices" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>offices</B><BR/>Офисы</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="code"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>code</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="kind"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>kind</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="city_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>city_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_en"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_en</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="has_saleroom"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>has_saleroom</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="opened_on"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>opened_on</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="closed_on"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>closed_on</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "staff" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>staff</B><BR/>Сотрудники</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="office_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>office_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="department_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>department_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="role"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>role</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="first_name"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>first_name</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="last_name"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>last_name</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="hired_on"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>hired_on</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="left_on"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>left_on</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "increment_bands" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>increment_bands</B><BR/>Шаги ставки</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="valid_from"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>valid_from</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="from_amount"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>from_amount</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="step"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>step</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "fee_schedules" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>fee_schedules</B><BR/>Шкалы и сборы</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="code"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>code</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="kind"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>kind</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="basis"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>basis</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="applies_to"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>applies_to</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="department_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>department_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="valid_from"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>valid_from</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="valid_to"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>valid_to</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="rate_pct"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>rate_pct</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="fixed_amount"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">○ </FONT>fixed_amount</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="name_ru"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>name_ru</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
    "fee_tiers" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" BGCOLOR="white"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#cfcfcf" CELLPADDING="6"><B>fee_tiers</B><BR/>Ступени шкал</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="schedule_id"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>schedule_id</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="tier_no"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono"># </FONT>tier_no</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="from_amount"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>from_amount</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" PORT="rate_pct"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono">∗ </FONT>rate_pct</TD></TR><TR><TD CELLPADDING="1"></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
  }
  "departments":"id" -> "categories":"department_id";
  "categories":"id":e -> "categories":"parent_id":e [style=dashed];
  "cities":"id" -> "offices":"city_id";
  "offices":"id" -> "staff":"office_id";
  "departments":"id" -> "staff":"department_id" [style=dashed];
  "departments":"id" -> "fee_schedules":"department_id" [style=dashed];
  "fee_schedules":"id" -> "fee_tiers":"schedule_id";
}
